# settings-keys (SM · States › Keyboard): the keyboard through the menu. Tab twice reaches the gear
# (the wordmark first: Chromium's stops, plan call 3 f; WebKit's plain Tab skips both, so judge
# this against Chromium's shots); Enter opens the panel with the focus on the checked theme, its
# 2 px line showing (D3, D10); the arrows pick and wrap, Home and End go to the ends, each theme
# applying at once; Shift+Tab reaches the toggle, whose arrows apply the mode (Light swaps the list
# to the light themes, its content fading in); Tab back to the list; Esc closes the panel and the
# gear shows its ring (plan call 3 g).
# Positions at 1440 x 900 from the reference's DOM with the panel open (tools/run dom): the gear
# (1363, 28, 40 x 40), the panel (1099, 76, 304 x 256); the Appearance toggle's options 91.33 x 34
# from (1113, 112) (System, Light, Dark: centres 1159, 1251, 1343 at y 129); the theme rows 278 x 36
# from (1112, 211), 36 apart (centres at y 229, 265, 301); the help line (1112, 155, 278 x 18); the
# gap between the two settings y 173 to 189. The panel's opening runs 643 ms, so a shot of it at
# rest waits 700.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode system
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
tab
wait 16
shot gear-focus
key Enter
wait 700
shot open-by-key
key ArrowDown
wait 16
shot down-tron-cyan
key ArrowRight
wait 16
shot right-midnight-violet
key ArrowDown
wait 16
shot down-wraps-arctic-ice
key ArrowUp
key ArrowLeft
key Home
wait 16
shot home-arctic-ice
key End
wait 16
shot end-midnight-violet
tab shift
wait 16
shot toggle-focus
key ArrowRight
wait 200
shot toggle-light
key ArrowRight
wait 200
shot toggle-dark
key ArrowRight
wait 200
shot toggle-wraps-system
key End
key Home
wait 200
shot toggle-home
tab
wait 16
shot list-focus
key Escape
wait 300
shot escape
